### Remediation P0: clampInt inconsistent signatures

The 4 report-cited files that had **inline** clampInt definitions with wrong arg order now import from shared:

```
$ grep 'import.*clampInt' server/services/adminAuditTrail.ts server/services/rememberMe.ts \
  server/routes/adminInstitutionalAudit.ts server/cron/evaluateChallenges.ts
→ All 4 import { clampIntOr } from "@shared/scalars"
```

### Remediation P1: Auth @ts-nocheck + Trade tests

- Auth files: confirmed clean (see F1)
- Trade tests: `tradeOpen.test.ts`, `tradeClose.test.ts`, `tradeCancel.test.ts` all exist

