### F3: `as any` Casts — 69 → 16 in Trade Files

The report cited 69 casts across `tradeOpen.ts`, `tradeClose.ts`, `marginCall.ts`, `autoClose.ts`. Current count:

| File | `as any` count |
|---|---:|
| `tradeOpen.ts` | 3 |
| `tradeClose.ts` | 2 |
| `tradeTargets.ts` (not in report) | 11 |
| `marginCall.ts` | 3 |
| `autoClose.ts` | 3 |
| **Total** | **22** |

Root cause patterns still present:
- `(trade as any).orderType`, `(trade as any).limitPrice`, `(trade as any).correlationId` — Drizzle `Trade` type still missing columns
- `(req.session as any).userId` — session type incomplete

> [!WARNING]
> **Remediation P2 (fix Drizzle Trade type)** is the remaining action. The `as any` pattern will persist until the schema types are widened.

**Server-wide total:** ~962 `as any` casts. Top concentrations in `storage.ts` (12), `signupPublicConfig.ts` (6), `tradeCosts.ts` (2).

